ast\u001b[77G9 in 10 of \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe lines she'd call vague, and pass \u001b[41Gt\u001b[43Gleast 9 in 10\u001b[57Gof the ones she'd call clear. We \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdon't want it blocking \u001b[27Good\u001b[31Gi\u001b[33Gvoice\u001b[39G.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mThought for \u001b[1m1s\u001b[22m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'll\u001b[8Gstart\u001b[14Gby\u001b[17Gexploring\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gcodebase\u001b[40Gto\u001b[43Gunderstand\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gexisting\u001b[67Gpatterns.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading\u001b[11GCLAUDE.md\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  CLAUDE.md\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
